    <string name="rationale_title">Health Connect Permissions</string>
    <string name="rationale_body">MyRunSync reads your running sessions, distance, heart rate, and cadence from Health Connect solely to compute summary metrics and 1-minute downsampled series and store them in your Supabase account. When background auto-sync is enabled, MyRunSync also reads these metrics periodically in the background.</string>
